  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Bows_And_Arrows/BH_MBAA_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">「更多弓與箭」的目標是添加各式各樣具備新能力、更高傷害，最重要的是更具使用樂趣的弓與箭。同時始終致力於保持遊戲體驗盡可能「原汁原味」，但對弓與箭進行重大改進。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要伺服器與朋友同樂嗎？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Bows_And_Arrows/BH_MBAA_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">若您正在尋找能與朋友遊玩任何模組或模組包的伺服器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong>正是您的最佳選擇！他們提供性價比最高的Minecraft伺服器，點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>並使用代碼「Lupin」即可享受25%折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Bows_And_Arrows/BH_MBAA_summary.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">除了添加多樣化的弓與箭（例如可發射TNT或造成更高傷害），還新增了六種附魔，具備極富趣味的機制，例如加快拉弓速度或同時發射多支箭矢。</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjason13official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860325/description_e69745c8-b22d-4d0d-a55e-5c131ae1fe50.webp\" alt=\"Jason13 Ko-Fi\" width=\"286\" height=\"73\"></span></span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Bows_And_Arrows/BH_MBAA_faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>是否與其他添加弓或箭的模組相容？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">原則上使用這些弓搭配其他同類型模組添加的箭矢應無問題。若遇到任何相容性問題，歡迎聯繫我們，我們將立即著手處理。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>可在伺服器上運作嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！運作完全正常！請記住，與朋友遊玩模組的最佳方式是使用BisectHosting，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此連結可享25%折扣</a></strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此模組可用於模組包嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！但僅限發布於Modrinth或CurseForge平台。上傳至其他平台將侵犯我們的權利，絕對不允許。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，若您考慮將本模組加入您的Modrinth或CurseForge模組包，我們將不勝感激。如需任何微調或有疑問，請隨時聯繫我們！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以在頻道錄製此模組的影片嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然，歡迎您在頻道遊玩此模組或我們的任何模組包並製作相關影片，我們對此深表感謝！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Bows_And_Arrows/BH_MBAA_images.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1232/338/more-bows-and-arrows-2.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1232/339/more-bows-and-arrows-3.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/195/more-bows-and-arrows-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1063\"></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p>",
